Description: OpenTelemetry Protobuf encoding (common)
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package provides shared OTLP protobuf encoding helpers used by the
 OpenTelemetry OTLP exporters (gRPC and HTTP) to translate spans, metrics
 and log records into their OTLP protobuf wire representations.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
